rooms_desc ({"This is the grand entrance hall to Waldo's house. From the ceiling you cansee a beautiful crystal chandilier. The floor is carpetted with softPersian carpet - and as you wipe your feet on the mat provided, you heara soft bell ringing in the distance.","This is Waldo's storage room. In it you can see arrayed the weaponsthat he has use of in his adventuring, from the Orc Shaman's swordto the power shuto he wields as a ninja. The weaponry on displayis awesome to say the least. Also, you can see a notice boardthat displays the quests he has done.","This is the bedroom of the Master of the house, it contains what appearsto be an old Victorian bed and a matching dresser.The room is extremely spacious and has soft gentle lighting eminatingfrom the candle mounted in the walls.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"The entrance hall of Waldo's house.","Waldo's storage room","The Master's bedroom",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
